<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- LibreView's mark as an app icon: libreview.com's favicon (the only icon the site publishes, 32 px), traced as a
     vector in its own colours — a sensor above glucose bars on LibreView blue. The favicon's tile becomes the
     background layer (the device's icon mask shapes it, as for every app icon); the 32-unit favicon fills the 72 dp
     visible area of the 108 dp adaptive canvas. Abbott's terms allow its marks "to identify the product or services of
     the company", which is the only place Sukrara shows it (docs/10-showcase.md "Service and app icons"). -->
